     "body": "<p>Log for UI error: </p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>DEBUG 12:19:14.549 (PathNotFoundExceptionMapper) PathNotFoundExceptionMapper intercepted exception:{} \r\n\r\njavax.jcr.PathNotFoundException: No node exists at path '/super-frog/fedora:timemap' in workspace \"default\"\r\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.cachedNode(JcrSession.java:634)\r\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.node(JcrSession.java:666)\r\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.node(JcrSession.java:685)\r\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.getNode(JcrSession.java:869)\r\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.getNode(JcrSession.java:852)\r\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.JcrSession.getNode(JcrSession.java:126)\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<p>A curl command on the same timemap works fine.  Odd. </p>\n\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>BuckyKatt:/Users/bseeger/Projects/fedora/fcrepo4&gt;curl localhost:8080/fcrepo5/rest/super-frog/fcr:versions -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -vv\r\n* Hostname was NOT found in DNS cache\r\n*   Trying ::1...\r\n* connect to ::1 port 8080 failed: Connection refused\r\n*   Trying 127.0.0.1...\r\n* Connected to localhost (127.0.0.1) port 8080 (#0)\r\n* Server auth using Basic with user 'fedoraAdmin'\r\n&gt; GET /fcrepo5/rest/super-frog/fcr:versions HTTP/1.1\r\n&gt; Authorization: Basic ZmVkb3JhQWRtaW46ZmVkb3JhQWRtaW4=\r\n&gt; User-Agent: curl/7.37.1\r\n&gt; Host: localhost:8080\r\n&gt; Accept: */*\r\n&gt; \r\n&lt; HTTP/1.1 200 \r\n&lt; Cache-Control: private\r\n&lt; Expires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT\r\n&lt; Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID=F3D210A17228361454EB5D2DD4B2FB31; Path=/fcrepo5; HttpOnly\r\n&lt; Set-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/fcrepo5; Max-Age=0; Expires=Wed, 07-Nov-2018 17:03:53 GMT\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Resource&gt;;rel=\"type\"\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#Container&gt;;rel=\"type\"\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource&gt;; rel=\"type\"\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#BasicContainer&gt;;rel=\"type\"\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo5/rest/super-frog&gt;; rel=\"timegate\"\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo5/rest/super-frog&gt;; rel=\"original\"\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo5/rest/super-frog/fcr:versions&gt;; rel=\"timemap\"\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeMap&gt;; rel=\"type\"\r\n&lt; Accept-External-Content-Handling: copy,redirect,proxy\r\n&lt; Vary-Post: Memento-Datetime\r\n&lt; Accept-Post: text/turtle,text/rdf+n3,text/n3,application/rdf+xml,application/n-triples,application/ld+json\r\n&lt; Allow: POST,HEAD,GET,OPTIONS\r\n&lt; Link: &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo5/rest/super-frog/fcr:versions/fcr:acl&gt;; rel=\"acl\"\r\n&lt; Preference-Applied: return=representation\r\n&lt; Vary: Prefer\r\n&lt; Vary: Accept\r\n&lt; Vary: Range\r\n&lt; Vary: Accept-Encoding\r\n&lt; Vary: Accept-Language\r\n&lt; Content-Type: text/turtle;charset=utf-8\r\n&lt; Content-Length: 521\r\n&lt; Date: Thu, 08 Nov 2018 17:03:53 GMT\r\n&lt; \r\n@prefix memento:  &lt;http://mementoweb.org/ns#&gt; .\r\n@prefix rdf:  &lt;http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&gt; .\r\n@prefix fedora:  &lt;http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#&gt; .\r\n@prefix ldp:  &lt;http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#&gt; .\r\n\r\n&lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo5/rest/super-frog/fcr:versions&gt;\r\n        rdf:type          fedora:TimeMap ;\r\n        rdf:type          fedora:Resource ;\r\n        memento:original  &lt;http://localhost:8080/fcrepo5/rest/super-frog&gt; ;\r\n        rdf:type          ldp:RDFSource ;\r\n        fedora:writable   true .\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
